<!DOCTYPE html>

<html>

<head>

<meta http-equiv="Content-Type"

content="text/htm; charset=UTF-8">

<title> JSP program to display "Lalitpur, Nepal" 10 times</title>

</head>

<body>

<h1>Displaying "Lalitpur, Nepal" 10 times!!</h1>

<table>

<%

for(int i=1;i<=10; i++){

%>


